","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","color":"447777","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":345,"closed_issues":2336,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T08:21:32Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-09-22T19:44:35Z","updated_at":"2026-09-26T15:21:26Z","closed_at":"2026-09-26T15:13:20Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123728","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123728","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123728.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123728.patch","merged_at":"2026-09-26T15:13:20Z"},"body":"## TLDR\r\n\r\nSpeeds up selecting files in the file system dock by 50%, by removing a secondary `.import` file load per selected file.\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nI noticed that selecting a folder with many files (2000+) in the FileSystem dock freezes the editor for a few seconds, so I decided to investigate.\r\n\r\nI found that we load the `.import` files two times:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1640\" height=\"746\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ed2ca62f-1b76-4423-a0da-80aaea675a4d\" />\r\n\r\nBut the only purpose of loading those files in `FileSystemDock::_update_import_dock()` was to check if they were valid (which all the called functions already check) and that they are the same type (only matters when there are more than 1 file selected), which we can make `ImportDock::set_edit_multiple_paths()` do instead at minimal extra cost.\r\n\r\nSo, by removing the loading of `.import` files from `FileSystemDock::_update_import_dock()` we speed up selecting files in the FileSystem dock by around 50%.\r\n\r\nBefore: (removed calls marked in red)\r\n<img width=\"1640\" height=\"746\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6a591bdd-e816-43dd-a9f8-8256484d7e1c\" />\r\n\r\nAfter:\r\n<img width=\"1641\" height=\"707\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/56658901-3ca9-4d8a-9dab-9d945dec5a11\" />\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nThe only behavioral change is that `ImportDock::set_edit_multiple_paths()` continues (but still prints an error) when a `.import` is missing/corrupted, but that is a single line fix if nessecary, but I think that this is better.\r\n\r\nTested using the mrp from https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123643 by selecting the \"test\" folder.\r\n\r\nNo AI was used.\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123728/reactions","total_count":14,"+1":5,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":7,"eyes":2},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123728/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}